@Dashboard.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Read surface — health check
GET {{Dashboard.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Read surface — matrix
GET {{Dashboard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/deployments
Accept: application/json

###

### Read surface — topology config (unauthenticated)
GET {{Dashboard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/config/topology
Accept: application/json

###

### Write surface — ingest deployment (requires X-Api-Key)
POST {{Dashboard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/deployments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: replace-me

{
  "deployment_id": "gh-run-1",
  "service":       "web-portal",
  "environment":   "dev",
  "version":       "v0.0.1",
  "status":        "success",
  "run_url":       "https://example.com/runs/1",
  "run_number":    1,
  "actor":         "tester"
}

###
